nt of the messaging application with the Kafka broker to the cloud (AWS) where replicated instances are maintained which are served with Elastic Load Balancers to forward requests fairly. ","topics":[],"score":201985,"global_rank":305737},{"name":"billcoury/news_scraper","owner":"billcoury","html_url":"https://github.com/billcoury/news_scraper","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":8,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":201985,"global_rank":305738},{"name":"nomadik223/About-Me","owner":"nomadik223","html_url":"https://github.com/nomadik223/About-Me","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"This is the first 201 project for Week 1, Austin Rogers","topics":[],"score":201980,"global_rank":305742}]